DESCRIPTION:This post contains affiliate links. We earn a commission if you
	 purchase tickets through our links at no extra cost to you. \nOfficial Ti
	ckets\nResale Tickets\nKelly Collette LIVE at Loony Bin Comedy Club Tulsa\
	nDon’t miss Kelly Collette for one night only at Loony Bin Comedy Club Tul
	sa! A standup comedian\, writer\, and storyteller\, Kelly has gained milli
	ons of views on social media with her hilarious\, relatable content. This 
	is a rare chance to see her live in Tulsa. \nEvent Details\nDate: Sunday\,
	 August 9\, 2026\nTime: 6:00 PM (Doors open 5:00 PM)\nVenue: Loony Bin Com
	edy Club Tulsa\nAddress: 6808 S Memorial Dr\, Ste. 234\, Tulsa\, OK 74133\
	nAge Requirement: 18+ Only\nTicket Price: $22 \nAbout Kelly Collette\nKell
	y Collette is a standup comedian\, writer\, and storyteller who has built 
	a massive social media following with her hilarious\, authentic content. H
	er clips have gained millions of views across platforms\, making her one o
	f the most exciting rising voices in comedy. Known for her sharp wit\, rel
	atable humor\, and engaging storytelling\, Kelly brings the same energy an
	d authenticity to her live performances that has made her a fan favorite o
	nline. \nWhat to Expect\n\nHilarious stand-up comedy from a viral social m
