DESCRIPTION:This post contains affiliate links. We earn a commission if you
	 purchase tickets through our links at no extra cost to you. \n\nOfficial 
	Tickets\nResale Tickets\n\nVincent Bryant LIVE at Punch Line Comedy Club –
	 Sacramento\nStand-up comedian Vincent Bryant is coming to Punch Line Come
	dy Club in Sacramento on August 9\, 2026! Known for his high-energy perfor
	mances and hilarious takes on everyday life\, Vincent Bryant delivers a co
	medy show that will have you laughing from start to finish. \nEvent Detail
	s\nDate: Sunday\, August 9\, 2026\nTime: 7:00 PM (Doors open at 6:00 PM)\n
	Venue: Punch Line Comedy Club – Sacramento\nAddress: 2100 Arden Way\, Sacr
	amento\, CA 95825\nAge Requirement: 18+ with valid government-issued photo
	 ID\nBeverage Minimum: 2 beverages per person \nAbout Vincent Bryant\nVinc
	ent Bryant is a dynamic stand-up comedian who has built a strong following
	 through his relatable humor and energetic stage presence. With a style th
	at blends sharp observations with personal storytelling\, Vincent has beco
	me a fan favorite on the comedy circuit\, performing at clubs and festival
	s across the country. \nWhat to Expect\n\nHigh-energy stand-up comedy perf
	ormance\nRelatable humor and personal storytelling\nSharp observational co
	medy\nIntimate club atmosphere at Sacramento’s premier comedy venue\nFull 
	bar service with 2-beverage minimum\n\nVenue Information\nPunch Line Comed
	y Club – Sacramento is located at 2100 Arden Way in Sacramento\, CA. One o
	f the top comedy clubs in Northern California\, it features a full bar\, g
	reat sightlines\, and ample free parking in the shopping center lot. \nTic
	ket Information\nTickets start from $37. This is an 18+ event with a 2-bev
	erage minimum per person. Tickets are available through Ticketmaster (offi
	cial) or VividSeats (resale). \n\nOfficial Tickets\nResale Tickets\n\nThis
	 post contains affiliate links. We earn a commission if you purchase ticke
	ts through our links at no extra cost to you. \nAll sales are final. Show 
	times subject to change. Valid photo ID may be required for entry.\n\nhttp
	s://comedycalendar.com/event/vincent-bryant-live-at-punch-line-comedy-club
	-sacramento/\n\nFrom Comedy Calendar
URL:https://comedycalendar.com/event/vincent-bryant-live-at-punch-line-come
	dy-club-sacramento/
