	to keep what you pull from the packs you open!\n\nBandai participation + w
	inner pack \n  \n📋 Registration Details:\n\nDoors Open: 3:00 PM\nOn-Site R
	egistration starts: 6:00 PM\nRound 1 Begins: 7:00 PM\n\nhttps://ccs-housto
	n.com/events/one-piece-4th-anniversary-op17-pre-release/\n\nFrom CCS Houst
