	t the Box Office. Box Office opens 1 hour prior to door times. You will ne
	ed a valid photo ID and the credit card used for purchase. ADA tickets can
	 be purchased online - you do not need to call the box office to place an 
	order. Look for the logo on the Find Tickets page to view all available ac
	cessible seats. We do have accessible seating in every price range but be 
