	udio recording devices are not permitted. $.25 per each ticket sold for a 
	majority of events at Punch Line benefits Comedy Gives Back\, a safety net
	 for the comedy community. For more information\, please visit www.comedyg
	ivesback.com Our events often run for multiple dates/times. Before purchas
	ing\, please ensure that you can attend the specific event\, date\, and ti
